{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nViuTV戀愛配對節目《直樂VIURIETY The Choose Day 2.0》近日開播，上一季未能成功出pool的性感網紅水爺再度登場。擁有超過十萬名粉絲的她曾開出極度嚴苛擇偶條件並連環拒絕兩位男士，瞬間引發大批網民猛烈抨擊。這位被封為「翻版林襄」話題人物背後暗藏一段極具反差驚人黑歷史。\n</p>\n<h2>《直樂VIURIETY》女嘉賓爆嚴苛擇偶條件</h2>\n<p>水爺曾於上一季配對失敗，今次重返ViuTV節目《直樂VIURIETY The Choose Day 2.0》尋找真愛。她曾在鏡頭前大方公開極高標準，除了要求另一半身高至少有180cm及具備運動身型，五官與牙齒亦必須標緻整潔，更直言「希望另一半長得像車銀優」。面對兩位男嘉賓主動表白，她以相處時間太短為由全數婉拒，加上期間疑似黑面，隨即被批評脫離現實。</p>\n<h2>當事人急發聲明為黑面風波向觀眾致歉</h2>\n<p>當時節目播出後引發全城熱議，面對排山倒海負評，水爺迅速在個人社交平台發佈長文親自滅火。針對拒絕男嘉賓一事，她解釋「不過時間太少，無辦法再了解對方多啲，所以我最後冇作出選擇」。對於被指在鏡頭前擺出傲慢姿態，她特意澄清當時純粹因為處於尷尬狀態才造成誤會，並公開向觀眾致歉承諾會加以改善。</p>\n<h2>翻版林襄自揭曾涉偷竊激嬲母親終決裂</h2>\n<p>現時擁有傲人身材及超過十萬粉絲追蹤，經常以超短裙及露腰裝出席跑車與酒吧活動，被網民譽為「翻版林襄」及「香港車模女神」。這位性感KOL曾在另一個訪談節目中自揭原本是成績優異學霸，因遭遇校園欺凌誤交損友，甚至刻意打扮成不良少女及參與偷竊。直到有次被警察上門拘捕，其母親崩潰拋下一句「我真係對你好失望，我以後都唔會再信你啦」，才令她徹底清醒並與黑社會勢力割席。</p>\n<h2>網民熱烈討論人氣性感網紅能否獲真愛</h2>\n<p>隨著驚人背景曝光，大批觀眾對她的態度發生大反轉，紛紛湧入社交平台留言表達看法。有網民佩服她公開不堪往事的勇氣，直言「好佩服佢可以咁坦白分享自己嘅過去」，亦有人認為「佢而家嘅成就證明人係可以改變嘅」。部分觀眾開始關注她今次再戰戀愛綜藝的表現，留言討論經歷過往跌撞及上一季失敗後，她能否調整心態並順利覓得真命天子。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/im-mckitty_1748449556abcdd8825553-1024x1363.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：IG@waterladysy）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1278\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/im-mckitty_1748449556abcdd8825553-1024x1363.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>（圖片來源：IG@waterladysy）</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/-_14257446466abcdcc36662f-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"水爺 直樂viuriety （圖片來源：Viutv）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/-_14257446466abcdcc36662f-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Viutv）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/-_16957176006abcde0d66e6e-1024x1161.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"水爺 直樂viuriety 水爺曾參加《直樂VIURIETY The Choose Day 1.0》（圖片來源：IG@waterladysy）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1088\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/-_16957176006abcde0d66e6e-1024x1161.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>水爺曾參加《直樂VIURIETY The Choose Day 1.0》（圖片來源：IG@waterladysy）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/177065296819772052_1426217988698a05287414a.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"水爺 直樂viuriety 水爺自揭曾偷竊（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/177065296819772052_1426217988698a05287414a.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>水爺自揭曾偷竊（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/177065297461843369_1188788793698a052ec009d.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"水爺 直樂viuriety 水爺自揭曾偷竊（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/177065297461843369_1188788793698a052ec009d.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>水爺自揭曾偷竊（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/__9534577186abcdd763213c-1024x1024.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"水爺 直樂viuriety （圖片來源：IG@waterladysy）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/__9534577186abcdd763213c-1024x1024.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@waterladysy）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/_17019516306abcdd7837d53-1024x1280.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"水爺 直樂viuriety （圖片來源：IG@waterladysy）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/_17019516306abcdd7837d53-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@waterladysy）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/-_14287506186abcdd79dd043-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"水爺 直樂viuriety （圖片來源：IG@waterladysy）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/-_14287506186abcdd79dd043-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@waterladysy）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/-_10208736866abcdd7c72bbd-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"水爺 直樂viuriety （圖片來源：IG@waterladysy）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/-_10208736866abcdd7c72bbd-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@waterladysy）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/-_10670309696abcdd80db88e-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"水爺 直樂viuriety （圖片來源：IG@waterladysy）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/-_10670309696abcdd80db88e-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@waterladysy）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/-_16950221506abcdd83a703a-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"水爺 直樂viuriety （圖片來源：IG@waterladysy）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/-_16950221506abcdd83a703a-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@waterladysy）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/do-you-wanna-play-a-game_13326345916abcdd86a362a-1024x1280.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"水爺 直樂viuriety （圖片來源：IG@waterladysy）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/do-you-wanna-play-a-game_13326345916abcdd86a362a-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@waterladysy）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T18:01:37.936288+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1377,"images":12,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T12:30:00+00:00","f